    airo:evidenceText "[1082] National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA) chief Mark Rosekind told Reuters on the sidelines of an event on highway safety that the agency is collecting more information to get a 'more detailed exploration of what exactly happened.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1082" .

