<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/aae1327be3e3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google admits its self driving car got it wrong: Bus crash was caused by software" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1082" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ad764b65d6da> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1088] Google has said it “bears some responsibility” for the first time." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1088" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/aed283127ea5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google's self-driving car had never been at fault in the 17 accidents the company reported to the California Department of Motor Vehicles." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1098" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b07d3db59287> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1095] From now on, our cars will more deeply understand that buses (and other large vehicles) are less likely to yield to us than other types of vehicles." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1095" .

