<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/882c4c4ddc0c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google has blamed other drivers for past collisions during testing, but, in a first, accepted at least partial responsibility for this crash." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1106" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8f7cbfd00921> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google has said it “bears some responsibility” for the first time." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1088" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e5c7c258711e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA) chief Mark Rosekind told Reuters on the sidelines of an event on highway safety that the agency is collecting more information to get a 'more detailed exploration of what exactly happened.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1082" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fcd5106031ec> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "On Valentine's Day, the inevitable happened to Google as one of its self-driving Lexuses was involved in a low-speed crash with a city bus." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1095" .

